      A personal fork of CrossPoint Reader; the foundation of this firmware
      (reader, HAL, UITheme, memory discipline, OTA/SD recovery).
  • CrossPoint Reader — https://github.com/crosspoint-reader/crosspoint-reader
      The upstream community firmware CrossInk forks. Tracked as an upstream
